elow.</p><div class=\"space-y-12\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-200 p-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-indigo-800 mb-6 pb-2 border-b border-gray-100\">Shipping &amp; Delivery</h2><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">How long does it take to get medication?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Usually it takes 1-2 business days depending on your location and the specific medication requested.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">How long does it take to get prescription?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Usually it takes 1-2 business days depending on your location and the specific prescription requested.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">How long does it take to get refill?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Usually it takes 1-2 business days depending on your location and the specific refill requested.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">How long does it take to get delivery?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Usually it takes 1-2 business days depending on your location and the specific delivery requested.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">How long does it take to get insurance claim?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Usually it takes 1-2 business days depending on your location and the specific insurance claim requested.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">How long does it take to get consultation?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Usually it takes 1-2 business days depending on your location and the specific consultation requested.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">How long does it take to get medical record?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Usually it takes 1-2 business days depending on your location and the specific medical record requested.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">How long does it take to get payment?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Usually it takes 1-2 business days depending on your location and the specific payment requested.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">How long does it take to get billing profile?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Usually it takes 1-2 business days depending on your location and the specific billing profile requested.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">How long does it take to get shipment?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Usually it takes 1-2 business days depending on your location and the specific shipment requested.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">Is medication covered by insurance?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Most major insurance plans cover medication. Please check with your provider for specific copay details.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">Is prescription covered by insurance?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Most major insurance plans cover prescription. Please check with your provider for specific copay details.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">Is refill covered by insurance?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Most major insurance plans cover refill. Please check with your provider for specific copay details.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">Is delivery covered by insurance?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Most major insurance plans cover delivery. Please check with your provider for specific copay details.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">Is insurance claim covered by insurance?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Most major insurance plans cover insurance claim. Please check with your provider for specific copay details.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">Is consultation covered by insurance?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Most major insurance plans cover consultation. Please check with your provider for specific copay details.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">Is medical record covered by insurance?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Most major insurance plans cover medical record. Please check with your provider for specific copay details.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">Is payment covered by insurance?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Most major insurance plans cover payment. Please check with your provider for specific copay details.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">Is billing profile covered by insurance?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Most major insurance plans cover billing profile. Please check with your provider for specific copay details.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">Is shipment covered by insurance?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Most major insurance plans cover shipment. Please check with your provider for specific copay details.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">What happens if I miss my delivery for medication?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Our courier will attempt redelivery the next day. A signature may be required for sensitive medication.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">What happens if I miss my delivery for prescription?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Our courier will attempt redelivery the next day. A signature may be required for sensitive prescription.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">What happens if I miss my delivery for refill?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Our courier will attempt redelivery the next day. A signature may be required for sensitive refill.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">What happens if I miss my delivery for delivery?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Our courier will attempt redelivery the next day. A signature may be required for sensitive delivery.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">What happens if I miss my delivery for insurance claim?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Our courier will attempt redelivery the next day. A signature may be required for sensitive insurance claim.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">What happens if I miss my delivery for consultation?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Our courier will attempt redelivery the next day. A signature may be required for sensitive consultation.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">What happens if I miss my delivery for medical record?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Our courier will attempt redelivery the next day. A signature may be required for sensitive medical record.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">What happens if I miss my delivery for payment?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Our courier will attempt redelivery the next day. A signature may be required for sensitive payment.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">What happens if I miss my delivery for billing profile?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Our courier will attempt redelivery the next day. A signature may be required for sensitive billing profile.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">What happens if I miss my delivery for shipment?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Our courier will attempt redelivery the next day. A signature may be required for sensitive shipment.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">Can I track my medication?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Yes, you will receive a tracking link via email or SMS once your medication has been dispatched.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">Can I track my prescription?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Yes, you will receive a tracking link via email or SMS once your prescription has been dispatched.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">Can I track my refill?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Yes, you will receive a tracking link via email or SMS once your refill has been dispatched.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">Can I track my delivery?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Yes, you will receive a tracking link via email or SMS once your delivery has been dispatched.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">Can I track my insurance claim?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Yes, you will receive a tracking link via email or SMS once your insurance claim has been dispatched.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">Can I track my consultation?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Yes, you will receive a tracking link via email or SMS once your consultation has been dispatched.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">Can I track my medical record?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Yes, you will receive a tracking link via email or SMS once your medical record has been dispatched.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">Can I track my payment?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Yes, you will receive a tracking link via email or SMS once your payment has been dispatched.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">Can I track my billing profile?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Yes, you will receive a tracking link via email or SMS once your billing profile has been dispatched.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">Can I track my shipment?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Yes, you will receive a tracking link via email or SMS once your shipment has been dispatched.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">How do I update my medication information?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">You can update your medication settings directly from your patient dashboard under the Account section.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">How do I update my prescription information?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">You can update your prescription settings directly from your patient dashboard under the Account section.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">How do I update my refill information?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">You can update your refill settings directly from your patient dashboard under the Account section.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">How do I update my delivery information?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">You can update your delivery settings directly from your patient dashboard under the Account section.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">How do I update my insurance claim information?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">You can update your insurance claim settings directly from your patient dashboard under the Account section.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">How do I update my consultation information?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">You can update your consultation settings directly from your patient dashboard under the Account section.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">How do I update my medical record information?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">You can update your medical record settings directly from your patient dashboard under the Account section.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">How do I update my payment information?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">You can update your payment settings directly from your patient dashboard under the Account section.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">How do I update my billing profile information?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">You can update your billing profile settings directly from your patient dashboard under the Account section.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">How do I update my shipment information?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">You ca